title: "nf-g4rnaseq"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata, and also cite
  the underlying tools listed in CITATIONS.md.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Spencer
    family-names: Gray
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # add your ORCID
repository-code: "https://github.com/OWNER/nf-g4rnaseq"
url: "https://github.com/OWNER/nf-g4rnaseq"
abstract: >-
  A configurable Nextflow (DSL2) pipeline for RNA-seq differential expression
  integrated with G-quadruplex (G4) prediction and co-transcriptional RNA:DNA
  hybrid-G4 (PHQS) analysis, with GO/KEGG enrichment and GSEA.
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - differential expression
  - G-quadruplex
  - RNA:DNA hybrid G-quadruplex
  - PHQS
  - Nextflow
  - DESeq2
  - bioinformatics
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-06-06"
